/target

# nexus-connectors is a nested workspace (crate-per-connector, see
# ARCHITECTURE.md §3). Its Cargo.lock is now tracked so the CI drift check
# compares two reproducible lockfiles instead of a fresh resolution against
# the pinned root lock (which drifts whenever crates.io gets new compatible
# patch releases). The root Cargo.lock remains authoritative for release
# builds of the nexusflow binary; the connectors lock is only for the nested
# workspace's own CI checks.
crates/nexus-connectors/target
graphify-out/
.agents/
skills-lock.json
